  "core_user_outcome": "The campaign gains a runnable regional whole-economy loop that a GM can open and advance one month at a time. Three settlements with four social classes each carry tenure, rent, dues, tithes and taxes; agriculture, extraction, crafts, construction and services; occupations, payroll, employment, wages and migration; local and routed trade with carriers, tolls and spoilage; persistent prices, business accounts, deposits, reserves, credit, collateral, interest and default; and weather, harvest, war, monster, political and infrastructure shocks. Every run appends state, result and report history with exact hash lineage, and the reports say in campaign terms what changed, where, why, and what decisions are available. It does not replace the source-grounded Food-Sector Operator and does not advance canonical campaign time.",
