    "verification_method": "Authored by Codex on codex/baen-economy-engine-mvp and opened as draft PR #65 on 2026-08-29, targeting codex/campaign-finance-ledger rather than main, which is why it never landed. All 128 files are carried; three defects found on landing were fixed and are itemised in known_limitations. Verified on landing by running the code, not by reading its claims: the project's own suite is 462 tests and all 462 pass from a cleared __pycache__, with no test skipped, disabled or quarantined; the repository regression suite passes; the generated PROJECT_INDEX check passes; the vault-wide guards scoped to this change report zero blocking failures; and the third-party notice hash VALIDATION.md records was recomputed and matches exactly.",
    "verified_at": "2026-09-04"
